              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele ba-Aramu nibakabona kuti bazundwa kuba-Israyeli, bakatuma batumwa kuti batambe ba-Aramu-nyina ibakakede mutala lya-Firate, aSofaki silutwe wabasilumamba ba-Hadadezeri nguwakabazulwida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
