              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Davida naakaambilwa makani, wakabunganya ba-Israyeli boonse, wazubuka Jordano, wasika nkubakabede, wabamba mindando yakubalwisya. Elyo Davida naakamana kubamba mindando yakulwisya, ba-Aramu bakamulwisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
